Test sources that print a claim they decided themselves, outside `Verdict`: a format whose
one argument-consuming conversion is a bare `%b` at the end, behind a literal label
(gh-ocannl-668). Such a line is gated only by the golden diff, and a golden diff is
`dune promote`-able -- which is how a failure gets recorded as the expected output.

